  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Ecosystem Initiative &#x2013; Establishing a collaboration platform to boost youth entrepreneurship in Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to form a network of relevant and motivated stakeholders in the Chadian entrepreneurial ecosystem, and to facilitate exchange and cooperation between the stakeholders.Also, the aim is to connect them with the Netherlands mission in Chad and to formulate follow-up projects with insights gained from these Dutch ecosystem initiative events.This will be done by organizing meetings, visits and networking sessions among motivated stakeholders in the Chadian entrepreneurial ecosystem.</narrative>
  </description>
